      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babekisia bakhali ba ng'ali tawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho aloma abuwaanga busa ali babaandu balala balilekha lisuubila mu biise bimaliilisi. Balifukiilila roho babeeyi ne khuloonda kamekisio ke bisieeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamekisio nga ako kario kasalanisibwanga ne babaandu babeeyi nibo liiba lie mu mebaasio kabwe liafwa, oli liliosibwa ne sichuuma sibilile pie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu nga bano bari bekisia bali, buli bubi khureerana ne khulia biakhulia chingano nabulebe. Wele abuumba biakhulia ebio khuliibwa ne babaandu basuubila, enyuma we lisaba lie khu khuupila Wele orio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli siindu nisio Wele abuumba sili silayi, siakhulia se siliio sinyala sialobwa tawe, ne kakhali buli siindu sikhoya siakaanilwe ne lisaba lie khu khuupila Wele orio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sikila elomo eya Wele ne lisaba elio bikila siafukiililwa khu Wele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukholi omulayi owa Yesu Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaba no aana kamalaka kano khu bawandaayo, olaba omukholi omulayi owa Yesu Kristo nga ne weliisia mu roho khu makhuwa ke lisuubila nende ke liliekisia lia ng'ali nilio waloondile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali yiyaula khukhwama khu mbakha chikhali cha Wele, chikholaana khuboolwa tawe, wenasie mu mekisio ke bulamu bwe busuubilifu khu Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khunasia kumubili khuli ne bukhala, ne kakhali khukhwenasia ka roho khuli ne bukhala mu buli ngila, sikila khusuubisia khubao khwe bulamu bwa luno nende bwe chindaalo chichiicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yino eli elomo eya ng'ali, ekhoyeele khufukiililwa ne khusuubilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwekumianga ne khukhola kimilimo ne kamaani, sikila khwareere lilieyikina liefwe mu Wele omenyile mindali ooli Omuonia owa boosi ne lukali abo basuubila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baelesie kamalaka ne kamekisio kano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhalekha yesi yesi akhulekelesia ewe bali sikila oli omwana tawe, ne kakhali ba sisiekesio khu basuubili khubirira mu lilomaloma ne liiba liowo, busiime bwowo, lisuubila ne bukwalaafu bwowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabwila nga ne ndiicha, aana siise siowo ne kamaani khusoma kamaandiko mu baandu, khukhwilwacha ne khukhwekisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhalekha khurumikhira siianwa nisio wanyoola khubirira mu niko bang'oosi baloma, lundi nga basaakhulu bakhurakho kamakhono kabwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeana khukhola kano ne kumwoyo kwowo kwoosi nio babaandu boosi babone lichiililila liowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyaye wamwene ne khuliinda kamekisio kowo. Chiililila khukhola kano, sikila nokakhola, oleonia wamwene ne naabo bakhurekeeresianga ewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
